## 📘 Project Overview  

This personal project demonstrates a **full end-to-end supervised learning workflow**.  
The notebook covers regression tasks, including:

- Linear Regression & Multiple Regression  
- Model Evaluation Metrics (RMSE, MAE, R²)  
- Feature Selection & Regularisation (Ridge, Lasso, ElasticNet)  
- Decision Tree Regression  
- Ensemble Methods (Bagging & Random Forest)  
- Model Persistence & Deployment  

The workflow simulates a **real-world predictive modeling project**, from data preprocessing to model comparison and insights.

